                    "author": "@SukiyahParjan",
                    "likes": 4,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-04-01T03:15:54Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Hidayah itu milik Allah, hanya orang mudah menerima nasehat akan mendapatkan hidayah",
                    "author": "@ImamNafi-wr6sf",
                    "likes": 9,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-29T17:10:39Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Ini sangat bermamfaat",
                    "author": "@AntoMajid-t7l",
                    "likes": 3,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-31T08:17:53Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Jazakallahu khairan",
                    "author": "@bravoteam1333",
                    "likes": 1,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-04-02T16:11:22Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Subhannallah",
                    "author": "@khurotulainibintisofyan4782",
                    "likes": 3,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-31T03:19:06Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Allah SWT Maha Mendengar \u2764 Allah SWT maha melihat \u2764 katakanlah dengan nurani didalam hati kamu \u2764 Allah SWT melihat hati hati mereka setiap hamba hambanya (manusia) \u2764 insyallah \u2764 Allah SWT maha mengetahui siapa hamba hambanya yang mencari dengan hati tanpa dunia \u2764 dan lebih mementingkan akhirat agar Allah SWT dan nabi Muhammad SAW memasukkan saya bersama keluarga saya ke dalam surga yang sangat indah Amiin Yaallah\u2764\u2764\u2764\u2764\ud83d\ude2d\ud83d\ude2d\ud83d\ude2d\ud83d\ude07 ,Dialah Allah SWT yang maha menolong hambanya \u2764 yang mengasihani hambanya \u2764 yang maha melindungi hambanya \u2764 yang maha memberi kehidupan dan kenikmatan di dunia dan di akhirat \u2764\u2764 yang maha suci \u2764 yang maha memberikan rezeki yang berlimpah \u2764 semoga Allah menjauhkan kita dari siksa kubur dan siksa api neraka \u2764 dan menjaga kita dari perbuatan maksiat \u2764\u2764\u2764\ud83d\ude0d\ud83d\ude0d\ud83d\ude0d\ud83d\ude0d\ud83d\ude0d\ud83d\ude0d\ud83d\ude0d\ud83d\ude0d\ud83d\ude0d\ud83e\udd32\ud83e\udd70",
                    "author": "@GergeousYouth",
                    "likes": 1,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-04-02T04:46:00Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Masya Allah tabarakallah",
                    "author": "@niiaamiiir6155",
                    "likes": 0,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-04-03T10:25:54Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "\u0628\u0633\u0645  \u0627\u0644\u0644\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u0631\u062d\u0645\u0646  \u0627\u0644\u0631\u062d\u064a\u0645 \n\ud83d\udcab\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb\nJazakumullah  khair  ,ustadz \nBarakallahu   fikum",
                    "author": "@HerwaniSarmanSugianto",
                    "likes": 0,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-04-02T23:28:35Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Barakallahu fiik ustadz",
                    "author": "@ImamNafi-wr6sf",
                    "likes": 2,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-29T17:12:11Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Barakallahu",
                    "author": "@Abangganteng-j5o",
                    "likes": 1,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-29T13:52:49Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Pak ustadZ bolehkan sy berdoa sy ingin hidup berjalan sperti yg sy mau. Sya ingin punya usaha lalu org lain yg jalani syn hanya menerima keuntungan sisa ya amal. Sy hanya ingin setiap hari ibadah jalan2 mengunjungi masjid seluruh Indonesia maupun dunia. Lalu mendaptkan jodoh yg baik cantik rumah kendaraan dan susana di pedesaan kota . smoga doa sy terkabul.. Walapun agak lebay\ud83d\ude02",
                    "author": "@liminho_wacelay",
                    "likes": 0,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-04-04T16:59:56Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "\u2764\u2764",
                    "author": "@faraeinamddoon846",
                    "likes": 0,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-30T08:02:51Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Assalamualaikum warahmatullahi wabarakatuh Ustadz hafidzahullah",
                    "author": "@elvirawidyatiofficial8333",
                    "likes": 1,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-29T22:35:21Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Aamiin",
                    "author": "@mrrhasio5175",
                    "likes": 0,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-30T07:08:11Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Subhanallah Walhamdulillah walailllailahaillallah Wallahu Akbar \u2764\ufe0f \nAllah humma shollingala syayyidina Muhammad wangala ali syayyidina Muhammad \u2764\ufe0f",
                    "author": "@RoidahIdah-pu5cf",
                    "likes": 0,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-29T21:14:51Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Tp yg anehnya masih aj menganggap beliau ini orang sesat biasa disebut Wahabi .. sebuta itukah mata hatinya orang\" yg menganggap  beliau ini orang sesat \ud83d\ude22",
                    "author": "@aguspujianto9981",
